name: "imagegen"
description: "Generate or edit raster images when the task benefits from AI-created bitmap visuals such as photos, 
illustrations, textures, sprites, mockups, or transparent-background cutouts. Use when Codex should create a brand-new 
image, transform an existing image, or derive visual variants from references, and the output should be a bitmap asset 
rather than repo-native code or vector. Do not use when the task is better handled by editing existing 
