## Modelling boundaries

All moves below are proposed visual variants inside the existing outer envelopes, with the original pivots, snap ends, 
floor/soffit contact lands and colliders retained.
No new projection is needed; the permitted ceiling remains 15 mm, away from snap and contact faces.
Preserve the 4,000 mm bay, 600 mm façade sill, 4,300 mm floor-to-soffit height, 4,500 mm storey, 200 mm slab and 1,200 
× 2,400 mm service opening.
Recess depths are measured inward from the original exposed face; leave the opposite finish intact and do not combine 
opposing deep cuts through the same thin piece.
Keep end lands and route recesses continuous across module seams without cutting the mating surfaces.
The [kit README](../../README.md) and [kit source](../../kit_pieces.py) supply the existing envelopes and assembly 
