# Office kit detail · Round 4

**Status:** Target concepts for Alex's review · **Last updated:** 2026-11-12

[Contact sheet](contact_sheet_r4.png) · [Governing brief](FEEDBACK_03.md) · [Exact prompts and 
revisions](prompts_r4.json) · [Reference board](reference_board_r4.png)

Five families, ten directions, **twenty interior views and ten small rival insets**, made with the built-in ImageGen 
tool in **10 image tries**.
Each sheet places A on the left and B on the right, hero above and play below, with a small street inset occupying 
roughly a quarter of each play panel.
Both interior cameras were requested at 1,700 mm eye height; play views use a different position from the hero.
Street insets were requested from 12,000 mm across the gap, showing three floors.
The paintings are concept references, not measured drawings or engine captures; the modelling dimensions below govern 
a build.

## Direction and the whole floor

[FEEDBACK_03.md](FEEDBACK_03.md), including its Style section, governs this pass wherever older briefs or the bible's 
general style emphasis differ.
The added Frutiger Aero influence is architectural: glossy white, rounded negative cuts, sky-filled transparency, high 
frosted inserts and soft light within a restrained blue/white/silver/navy system.



